stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> running : POST /api/runs accepted

    running --> completed : every case scored
    running --> partial_failure : some cases errored
    running --> failed : every case errored

    completed --> [*]
    partial_failure --> [*]
    failed --> [*]

    note right of running
        Progress counters are committed
        per case, so a crash mid-run leaves
        a resumable, inspectable record.
    end note

    note right of partial_failure
        passed_cases + errored_cases = total_cases
        The run is still comparable, but the
        regression verdict should be read with
        the error rate in mind.
    end note

    note right of failed
        error_message is set to a sanitized
        summary such as "All provider requests
        failed." No API keys or headers are
        ever persisted.
    end note
